Lineage
-------

This module is a Kubernetes port of terraform-aws-n8n
(https://github.com/n8n-io/terraform-aws-n8n) and inherits its shape: one
resource-bearing root, the same variable and output naming, the same quality
bar. That project's authors are credited in its own repository. They have no
involvement in this one and are not responsible for it.
